{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":63,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主報應列國"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["這位身披紅衣、",{"text":"穿著華麗、充滿力量、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從以東的波斯拉闊步而來的是誰呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「是宣告公義、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有拯救大能的我。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"你的衣服為何是紅色的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像榨酒池中踩踏葡萄者的衣服？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"「我獨自在榨酒池踩踏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬民中無人跟我在一起。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我憤然踩踏他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"發烈怒踐踏他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的血濺到我的衣服上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玷污了我的衣服。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心中定了報仇的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我救贖我子民之年已經來臨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我環顧四周，卻無人幫助，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因無人扶持而驚訝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"於是，在烈怒的推動下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我用自己的臂膀施行拯救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在憤怒中踐踏萬民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓他們飽嘗我的烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他們的血倒在地上。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["頌讚與禱告"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"因耶和華為我們所做的一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要述說祂的慈愛和祂可歌可頌的作為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"述說祂憑憐憫和大愛賜給以色列人的厚恩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂說：「他們的確是我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不會背叛我。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，祂做他們的救主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂苦他們所苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"親自","poem":1},{"noteId":25},{"text":"拯救他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂本著慈愛和憐憫救贖了他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自古以來一直扶持、照顧他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"他們卻叛逆，使祂的聖靈憂傷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"於是，祂轉而與他們為敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"親自攻擊他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"後來，他們想起古時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"想起了摩西和他的百姓，便問，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶領百姓及其牧者摩西從海裡出來的那位在哪裡？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將自己的聖靈降在他們中間的那位在哪裡？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用榮耀的臂膀扶持摩西，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他們面前把海水分開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使自己威名永存的那位在哪裡？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶領他們經過大海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶如馬行平川不會失腳的那位在哪裡？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的靈使他們得到安歇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶如牲畜下到山谷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你就是這樣引領你的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以樹立自己榮耀的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你從天上垂顧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從你聖潔、榮耀的居所垂看。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的熱忱和大能在哪裡呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你不再眷愛、憐憫我們嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然亞伯拉罕不認識我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列不承認我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你是我們的父親。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你是我們的父親，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自古以來你就是我們的救贖主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊！你為何使我們偏離你的路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我們硬著心不敬畏你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你為了你的僕人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的產業——以色列各支派而回心轉意！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的聖民曾暫時擁有你的聖所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今我們的敵人已經踐踏了它。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們如此淪落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像從未被你治理過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從來不屬於你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":25,"caller":"+","text":"「親自」希伯來文是「祂面前的天使」。","reference":{"chapter":63,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/63.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/64.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/62.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}